              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kamuntu, profwetaku neyi, Mwanta Yehova nateni dehi anyana kaAmoni nikusawula kwasawulaŋawu; ilaku neyi, Mpoku yakabali, mpoku yakabali anayiholi dehi, anayilezumwishi dehi kulonda yakajahani, kulonda kuyidiishayi antu, yakekali neyi nzaji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iku achidi kukumwena yimwenu yakuhemesha, iku achidi kukuhoŋela yakutwamba, kulonda akakudatishi nshiŋu jawantu atama ataŋawu dehi chakujaha hohu, akweti ifuku dinenzi dehi mumpinji yakuluwa kwakukuminina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yifuntishi cheŋi muchindalu chayu. Mwituŋa diwavwalikili, mwakuleŋeleluwu, dimu nakakusompeshela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakwichila ndombu yami. Nakakupeŋa mukesi kakuzuwa kwami. Nakakuhana kudi antu adi neyi anyama, asweja maana akujilumuna akwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakekala nchawa jakusha hakesi; mashi eyi akekala mukachi ketuŋa; hiyakakwanuka nawa cheŋuku, muloŋa ami Yehova nachihoshi dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
